# File: big-remote-play/usr/share/big-remote-play/main.py, line: 58
#: src/big_remote_play/app.py:162
msgid ""
"The Story Behind the Project\n"
"\n"
"Big Remote Play was born from a real story of friendship, determination, and "
"the passion for Free Software.\n"
"\n"
"Alessandro e Silva Xavier (known as Alessandro) and Alexasandro Pacheco "
"Feliciano (known as Pacheco) wanted to play games together on BigLinux using "
"a feature that only existed on proprietary platforms like Steam Remote Play "
"and GeForce NOW. The problem? These systems are proprietary, locked to their "
"own ecosystems. If a game wasn't available on their platform, it was nearly "
"impossible to play remotely with friends.\n"
"\n"
"Refusing to accept this limitation, Alessandro and Pacheco embarked on a "
"journey of countless attempts and extensive research. After trying many "
"different approaches, they finally found a working solution by combining "
"multiple free software programs — including Sunshine, Moonlight, scripts, "
"and VPN tools. They had achieved what the proprietary platforms kept locked "
"behind their walls, and the best part: it was Free Software and multi-"
"platform!\n"
"\n"
"Excited by their success, they started sharing their achievement during "
"their live streams, which generated tremendous enthusiasm from the "
"community. However, there was a catch — the setup was complicated. It "
"required configuring multiple separate solutions: Sunshine, Moonlight, "
"custom scripts, VPN connections... it was a lot for anyone to handle.\n"
"\n"
"That's when a friend decided to step in and help develop a unified "
"application to simplify the entire process. And so, Big Remote Play was "
"born! 🎉\n"
"\n"
"An all-in-one application that integrates everything you need for remote "
"cooperative gaming — no proprietary platforms, no restrictions, no limits on "
"which games you can play."
msgstr ""
"Historien bag projektet\n"
"\n"
"Big Remote Play blev født ud fra en ægte historie om venskab, beslutsomhed "
"og passion for fri software.\n"
"\n"
"Alessandro e Silva Xavier (kendt som Alessandro) og Alexasandro Pacheco "
"Feliciano (kendt som Pacheco) ønskede at spille spil sammen på BigLinux ved "
"hjælp af en funktion, der kun eksisterede på proprietære platforme som Steam "
"Remote Play og GeForce NOW. Problemet? Disse systemer er proprietære, låst "
"til deres egne økosystemer. Hvis et spil ikke var tilgængeligt på deres "
"platform, var det næsten umuligt at spille på afstand med venner.\n"
"\n"
"Alessandro og Pacheco nægtede at acceptere denne begrænsning og begav sig ud "
"på en rejse med utallige forsøg og omfattende forskning. Efter at have "
"prøvet mange forskellige tilgange fandt de endelig en fungerende løsning ved "
"at kombinere flere frie softwareprogrammer — herunder Sunshine, Moonlight, "
"scripts og VPN-værktøjer. De havde opnået, hvad de proprietære platforme "
"holdt låst bag deres vægge, og den bedste del: det var fri software og multi-"
"platform!\n"
"\n"
"Begejstrede over deres succes begyndte de at dele deres præstation under "
"deres livestreams, hvilket genererede enorm entusiasme fra fællesskabet. Der "
"var dog en hage — opsætningen var kompliceret. Det krævede konfiguration af "
"flere separate løsninger: Sunshine, Moonlight, brugerdefinerede scripts, VPN-"
"forbindelser... det var meget for nogen at håndtere.\n"
"\n"
"Det var her, en ven besluttede at træde ind og hjælpe med at udvikle en "
"samlet applikation for at forenkle hele processen. Og således blev Big "
"Remote Play født! 🎉\n"
"\n"
"En alt-i-en applikation, der integrerer alt, hvad du behøver for "
"samarbejdsspil på afstand — ingen proprietære platforme, ingen "
"begrænsninger, ingen grænser for, hvilke spil du kan spille."

